-live-past-100-have-a-surprising-abundance-of-cancer-killing-immune-cells.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:37:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/people-who-live-past-100-have-a-surprising-abundance-of-cancer-killing-immune-cells</guid></item><item><title>新理论称认知和意识源自模拟计算</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cognition-and-consciousness-arise-from-analog-computations-says-new-theory</link><description>麻省理工学院皮考尔研究所神经科学家的一项新理论提出，认知和意识可能不仅取决于神经元和突触连接，还取决于神经活动产生的行波电波。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cognition-and-consciousness-arise-from-analog-computations-says-new-theory2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:22:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cognition-and-consciousness-arise-from-analog-computations-says-new-theory</guid></item><item><title>超导性的新旋转</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-new-spin-on-superconductivity</link><description>研究人员首次对难以捉摸的超导态进行了明确的测量。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-new-spin-on-superconductivity2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:07:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-new-spin-on-superconductivity</guid></item><item><title>将星星的力量与几何学联系起来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/connecting-the-power-of-the-stars-to-geometry</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 10:52:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/connecting-the-power-of-the-stars-to-geometry</guid></item><item><title>量子物质揭示的普遍模式</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/universal-pattern-revealed-in-quantum-matter</link><description>当不同的材料从一种相转变为另一种相时，例如水沸腾或磁铁失去吸引金属的能力，就会发生一些值得注意的事情：它们开始表现相同，遵循相同的数学规则。 “物理学家将这种特征称为普遍性——杂乱的微观细节被冲走，只有少数基本特征得以保留，”威廉·K·戴维斯理论物理学教授杰森·艾丽西亚解释道。这些普遍特征背后的数学通常由称为共形场论的理论框架来描述。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/universal-pattern-revealed-in-quantum-matter.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 10:37:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/universal-pattern-revealed-in-quantum-matter</guid></item><item><title>温和的化学发光有助于科学家捕获更清晰的活细胞图像</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/gentle-chemical-glow-helps-scientists-capture-sharper-images-of-living-cells</link><description>无论是拍摄小狗还是微观细胞，我们都会寻求更明亮、更好的照明来拍摄更清晰的照片。在大多数情况下，光线来自被拍摄物体的外部。一个&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/gentle-chemical-glow-helps-scientists-capture-sharper-images-of-living-cells2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 10:22:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/gentle-chemical-glow-helps-scientists-capture-sharper-images-of-living-cells</guid></item><item><title>将量子电池的环境敏感性转化为优势</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/turning-a-quantum-batterys-environmental-sensitivity-into-an-advantage</link><description>量子电池是一种利用量子力学现象存储能量的设备，原则上可以比传统电池充电更快、更高效。尽管它们具有潜力，但众所周知，将这些电池连接到充电器会产生量子相关性，从而可以在组合电池充电器系统内捕获一些能量。这可以减少有用功，或者可以单独从电池中提取的用于完成任务的能量。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/turning-a-quantum-batterys-environmental-sensitivity-into-an-advantage2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 10:07:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/turning-a-quantum-batterys-environmental-sensitivity-into-an-advantage</guid></item></channel></rss>